<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Ad Nova – Digital Marketing Agency</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --yellow:#FFD600;--yellow-d:#c9a800;--black:#0a0a0a;--white:#ffffff;
  --gray:#f6f6f6;--border:rgba(0,0,0,0.08);--text:#111;--muted:#777;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;background:var(--white);color:var(--text);overflow-x:hidden;cursor:none;}

/* ── CURSOR ── */
#cur{position:fixed;width:14px;height:14px;background:var(--yellow);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:99999;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:width .25s,height .25s;mix-blend-mode:multiply;}
#cur-ring{position:fixed;width:40px;height:40px;border:2px solid var(--yellow);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:99998;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);opacity:.45;transition:left .1s ease,top .1s ease,width .25s,height .25s,opacity .25s;}
.cur-big{width:50px!important;height:50px!important;}
.cur-ring-big{width:60px!important;height:60px!important;opacity:.25!important;}

/* ── CANVAS ── */
#bgc{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;}

/* ── SCROLLBAR ── */
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px;}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:#f0f0f0;}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--yellow);border-radius:3px;}

/* ── NAVBAR ── */
nav{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;z-index:1000;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,214,0,.25);
  padding:0 48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  height:72px;box-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
  transition:box-shadow .3s;
}
nav.scrolled{box-shadow:0 4px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.12);}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:30px;list-style:none;}
.nav-links a{
  color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:1.8px;text-transform:uppercase;transition:color .3s;position:relative;
}
.nav-links a::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-4px;left:0;width:0;height:2.5px;background:var(--yellow);transition:width .3s;border-radius:2px;}
.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.active{color:var(--yellow-d);}
.nav-links a:hover::after,.nav-links a.active::after{width:100%;}
.nav-logo img{height:54px;object-fit:contain;}
.hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;cursor:pointer;}
.hamburger span{width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--text);transition:.3s;}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   HERO
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
#home{
  min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  text-align:center;position:relative;padding:140px 20px 80px;overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:960px;}

/* floating shapes behind hero */
.hero-shape{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:1;}
.hs1{width:500px;height:500px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,214,0,.15),transparent 70%);top:-100px;left:-150px;animation:floatShape 8s ease-in-out infinite;}
.hs2{width:400px;height:400px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,214,0,.1),transparent 70%);bottom:-80px;right:-100px;animation:floatShape 10s ease-in-out 2s infinite reverse;}
.hs3{width:200px;height:200px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,214,0,.08),transparent 70%);top:40%;left:10%;animation:floatShape 7s ease-in-out 1s infinite;}
@keyframes floatShape{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}50%{transform:translateY(-30px) scale(1.05);}}

.hero-tag{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  background:rgba(255,214,0,.14);border:1.5px solid rgba(255,214,0,.5);
  color:var(--yellow-d);font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3.5px;text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:8px 24px;border-radius:50px;margin-bottom:30px;
  animation:fadeUp .8s ease both,tagPulse 3s ease-in-out 1s infinite;
}
@keyframes tagPulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,214,0,.3);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 12px rgba(255,214,0,0);}}

.hero-title{
  font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;
  font-size:clamp(72px,12vw,148px);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:3px;
  animation:fadeUp .8s ease .15s both;color:var(--black);
}
.hero-title .yt{
  color:var(--yellow);-webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--yellow-d);
  display:inline-block;animation:titleWave 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes titleWave{0%,100%{transform:skewX(0deg);}25%{transform:skewX(-2deg);}75%{transform:skewX(2deg);}}

.hero-sub{
  font-size:clamp(15px,2vw,20px);color:var(--muted);
  margin:26px auto 44px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.75;
  max-width:640px;animation:fadeUp .8s ease .3s both;
}

/* typed text */
.typed-wrap{font-size:clamp(16px,2.2vw,22px);font-weight:800;color:var(--yellow-d);
  margin-bottom:32px;animation:fadeUp .8s ease .38s both;min-height:36px;}
#typed{border-right:3px solid var(--yellow);padding-right:4px;}

.hero-btns{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;animation:fadeUp .8s ease .45s both;}
.btn-y{
  background:var(--yellow);color:var(--black);padding:16px 40px;border-radius:6px;
  font-weight:900;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;
  text-decoration:none;transition:all .3s;border:2px solid var(--yellow);
  box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(255,214,0,.45);
  animation:btnFloat 3s ease-in-out 1s infinite;
}
.btn-y:hover{background:transparent;color:var(--yellow-d);box-shadow:none;animation:none;}
@keyframes btnFloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-5px);}}
.btn-o{
  background:transparent;color:var(--black);padding:16px 40px;border-radius:6px;
  font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;
  text-decoration:none;transition:all .3s;border:2px solid rgba(0,0,0,.18);
}
.btn-o:hover{border-color:var(--yellow);color:var(--yellow-d);}

.hero-stats{
  display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:56px;margin-top:80px;
  animation:fadeUp .8s ease .6s both;flex-wrap:wrap;
  position:relative;
}
.hero-stats::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  width:80%;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(255,214,0,.3),transparent);
}
.stat{text-align:center;position:relative;}
.stat-num{
  font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:60px;color:var(--yellow);line-height:1;
  text-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(255,214,0,.35);
}
.stat-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:4px;font-weight:700;}

/* scroll indicator */
.scroll-ind{
  position:absolute;bottom:36px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  animation:fadeUp 1s ease 1s both;z-index:2;
}
.scroll-ind span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;}
.scroll-mouse{
  width:26px;height:40px;border:2px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2);border-radius:13px;
  display:flex;justify-content:center;padding-top:6px;
}
.scroll-wheel{
  width:4px;height:8px;background:var(--yellow);border-radius:2px;
  animation:scrollWheel 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes scrollWheel{0%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);}}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   SECTION BASE
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
section{padding:110px 40px;position:relative;z-index:1;}
.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;}
.sec-label{
  display:inline-block;color:var(--yellow-d);font-size:11px;font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px;
  background:rgba(255,214,0,.12);padding:6px 18px;border-radius:50px;
}
.sec-title{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:clamp(44px,6.5vw,80px);letter-spacing:2px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--black);}
.sec-title span{color:var(--yellow);}
.sec-desc{color:var(--muted);max-width:580px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:400;}

/* fade-in observer */
.fi{opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px);transition:opacity .75s ease,transform .75s ease;}
.fi.visible{opacity:1;transform:none;}
.fi-l{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-40px);transition:opacity .75s ease,transform .75s ease;}
.fi-l.visible{opacity:1;transform:none;}
.fi-r{opacity:0;transform:translateX(40px);transition:opacity .75s ease,transform .75s ease;}
.fi-r.visible{opacity:1;transform:none;}
.fi-s{opacity:0;transform:scale(.9);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease;}
.fi-s.visible{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   ABOUT
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
#about{background:var(--gray);overflow:hidden;}
#about::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:-100px;right:-200px;
  width:600px;height:600px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,214,0,.08),transparent 70%);
  border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;
  animation:floatShape 12s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.about-text p{color:#444;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:22px;}
.about-highlights{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:36px;}
.hbox{
  background:var(--white);border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;
  transition:all .35s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.hbox::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,214,0,.08),transparent);
  opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s;
}
.hbox:hover{border-color:var(--yellow);transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(255,214,0,.15);}
.hbox:hover::before{opacity:1;}
.hbox-icon{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:12px;display:block;
  transition:transform .35s;}
.hbox:hover .hbox-icon{transform:scale(1.2) rotate(-8deg);}
.hbox h4{font-size:13px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--black);}
.hbox p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px;line-height:1.55;}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   SERVICES
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
#services{background:var(--white);}
.services-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(340px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:60px;}
.svc{
  background:var(--white);border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;
  overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;transition:all .35s;position:relative;
  box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
  opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);
}
.svc.sv-in{animation:svcIn .55s ease forwards;}
@keyframes svcIn{to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
.svc:hover,.svc.open{border-color:var(--yellow);box-shadow:0 16px 48px rgba(255,214,0,.18);transform:translateY(-6px);}
.svc-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:26px 26px 22px;}
.svc-icon{
  width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;
  background:rgba(255,214,0,.12);border:1.5px solid rgba(255,214,0,.3);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;
  transition:all .35s;
}
.svc:hover .svc-icon,.svc.open .svc-icon{
  background:var(--yellow);transform:rotate(-8deg) scale(1.1);
}
.svc-head h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--black);flex:1;line-height:1.3;}
.svc-tog{
  width:32px;height:32px;background:var(--gray);border-radius:50%;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:20px;color:var(--yellow);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;
  transition:transform .35s,background .3s;
}
.svc.open .svc-tog{transform:rotate(45deg);background:var(--yellow);color:var(--black);}
.svc-div{height:1px;background:var(--border);margin:0 26px;transition:background .3s;}
.svc.open .svc-div{background:rgba(255,214,0,.4);}
.svc-body{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .45s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);}
.svc.open .svc-body{max-height:500px;}
.svc-body p{color:#555;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;padding:18px 26px 26px;}
.svc-num{position:absolute;top:12px;right:64px;font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:56px;color:rgba(255,214,0,.07);pointer-events:none;transition:color .3s;}
.svc:hover .svc-num{color:rgba(255,214,0,.14);}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   PACKAGES
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
#packages{background:var(--gray);}
#packages::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-80px;left:-120px;
  width:500px;height:500px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,214,0,.07),transparent 70%);
  border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;
}
.pkg-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:28px;margin-top:60px;}
.pkg{
  background:var(--white);border-radius:20px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);
  padding:40px 32px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  transition:transform .35s,box-shadow .35s,border-color .35s;
}
.pkg::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,214,0,.04),transparent 60%);
  opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s;
}
.pkg:hover{transform:translateY(-12px);box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(255,214,0,.2);border-color:var(--yellow);}
.pkg:hover::after{opacity:1;}
.pkg.feat{
  border-color:var(--yellow);
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fffbe6 0%,#fff 55%);
}
.pkg-badge{
  position:absolute;top:20px;right:20px;
  background:var(--yellow);color:var(--black);
  font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;
  padding:5px 14px;border-radius:50px;
  animation:badgePop 2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes badgePop{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);}50%{transform:scale(1.06);}}
.pkg-name{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:24px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--black);margin-bottom:6px;}
.pkg-suit{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.5;}
.pkg-price{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:60px;color:var(--yellow);line-height:1;}
.pkg-price sup{font-size:24px;vertical-align:top;margin-top:14px;font-family:'Outfit';color:var(--yellow-d);}
.pkg-price sub{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);font-family:'Outfit';font-weight:600;}
.pkg-div{height:1.5px;background:var(--border);margin:22px 0;}
.pkg-st{font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--yellow-d);margin:16px 0 10px;}
.pkg-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;}
.pkg-list li{font-size:13px;color:#444;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;line-height:1.55;}
.pkg-list li::before{content:"✅";flex-shrink:0;font-size:11px;margin-top:2px;}
.pkg-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:8px;}
.pkg-tag{background:rgba(255,214,0,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,214,0,.4);color:#7a5e00;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 13px;border-radius:50px;}
.pkg-sup{background:var(--gray);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-top:14px;}
.pkg-sup p{font-size:13px;color:#555;line-height:1.75;}
.pkg-cta{
  display:block;text-align:center;margin-top:28px;padding:15px;border-radius:10px;
  font-weight:900;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;
  text-decoration:none;transition:all .3s;
}
.pkg.feat .pkg-cta{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--black);box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(255,214,0,.45);}
.pkg.feat .pkg-cta:hover{background:var(--yellow-d);}
.pkg:not(.feat) .pkg-cta{background:transparent;color:var(--yellow-d);border:2px solid var(--yellow);}
.pkg:not(.feat) .pkg-cta:hover{background:var(--yellow);color:var(--black);}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   CLIENTS
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
#clients{background:var(--white);overflow:hidden;}
.c-rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;margin-top:60px;}
.c-row{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:6px 0;}
.c-row::before,.c-row::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:120px;z-index:2;pointer-events:none;}
.c-row::before{left:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--white),transparent);}
.c-row::after{right:0;background:linear-gradient(-90deg,var(--white),transparent);}
.c-track{display:flex;gap:18px;width:max-content;}
.c-track.r1{animation:scrollL 28s linear infinite;}
.c-track.r2{animation:scrollR 22s linear infinite;}
.c-track.r3{animation:scrollL 32s linear infinite;}
.c-row:hover .c-track{animation-play-state:paused;}
.c-logo{
  background:var(--white);border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;
  padding:16px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  width:168px;height:88px;flex-shrink:0;
  transition:all .35s;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.c-logo::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,214,0,.1),transparent);
  opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s;
}
.c-logo:hover{border-color:var(--yellow);transform:translateY(-6px) scale(1.06);box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(255,214,0,.22);}
.c-logo:hover::before{opacity:1;}
.c-logo img{max-width:120px;max-height:54px;object-fit:contain;transition:transform .35s;}
.c-logo:hover img{transform:scale(1.08);}
@keyframes scrollL{0%{transform:translateX(0);}100%{transform:translateX(-33.333%);}}
@keyframes scrollR{0%{transform:translateX(-33.333%);}100%{transform:translateX(0);}}

/* client count ribbon */
.clients-ribbon{
  text-align:center;margin-top:48px;padding:28px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,214,0,.1),rgba(255,214,0,.05));
  border:1.5px dashed rgba(255,214,0,.4);border-radius:16px;
  animation:ribbonPulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes ribbonPulse{0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,214,0,.15);}50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 16px rgba(255,214,0,0);}}
.clients-ribbon p{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);}
.clients-ribbon span{color:var(--yellow-d);font-size:28px;font-weight:900;font-family:'Bebas Neue';letter-spacing:2px;}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   PROJECTS
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
#projects{background:var(--gray);}
.proj-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:60px;}
.proj-card{
  background:var(--white);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;
  border:1.5px solid var(--border);transition:all .35s;cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);position:relative;
}
.proj-card:hover{border-color:var(--yellow);transform:translateY(-10px);box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(255,214,0,.18);}
.proj-img-w{overflow:hidden;height:200px;position:relative;}
.proj-img-w::after{
  content:'🔍';position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:rgba(255,214,0,.0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:36px;opacity:0;transition:all .35s;
}
.proj-card:hover .proj-img-w::after{background:rgba(255,214,0,.15);opacity:1;}
.proj-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .5s;}
.proj-card:hover .proj-img{transform:scale(1.1);}
.proj-info{padding:18px 20px;}
.proj-tag{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--yellow-d);background:rgba(255,214,0,.12);padding:3px 10px;border-radius:50px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:8px;}
.proj-info h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--black);}
.proj-overlay-txt{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(0,0,0,.7));color:#fff;padding:24px 20px 14px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;}
.proj-card:hover .proj-overlay-txt{opacity:1;}

/* ── LIGHTBOX ── */
#lb{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.95);z-index:9999;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px;animation:lbIn .25s ease;}
#lb.on{display:flex;}
@keyframes lbIn{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
#lb img{max-width:88vw;max-height:86vh;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 0 80px rgba(0,0,0,.8);animation:lbImgIn .3s ease;}
@keyframes lbImgIn{from{transform:scale(.9);opacity:0;}to{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;}}
#lb-x{position:absolute;top:22px;right:30px;color:#fff;font-size:40px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:300;opacity:.65;transition:opacity .2s,color .2s;}
#lb-x:hover{opacity:1;color:var(--yellow);}
#lb-p,#lb-n{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:var(--yellow);color:var(--black);border:none;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:900;transition:all .2s;z-index:10;}
#lb-p{left:22px;}#lb-n{right:22px;}
#lb-p:hover,#lb-n:hover{background:var(--yellow-d);transform:translateY(-50%) scale(1.1);}
#lb-count{position:absolute;bottom:22px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   CONTACT
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
#contact{background:var(--white);}
.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:60px;align-items:start;margin-top:60px;}
.ci{
  display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px;
  background:var(--gray);border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;
  transition:all .35s;margin-bottom:20px;
}
.ci:hover{border-color:var(--yellow);box-shadow:0 10px 32px rgba(255,214,0,.14);transform:translateX(6px);}
.ci-icon{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,214,0,.15);border:1.5px solid rgba(255,214,0,.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0;}
.ci h4{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:800;}
.ci a,.ci p{font-size:15px;color:var(--black);text-decoration:none;margin-top:5px;font-weight:700;display:block;word-break:break-all;}
.ci a:hover{color:var(--yellow-d);}
.soc-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.soc-btn{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--white);border:1.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;padding:12px 18px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--black);
  font-size:13px;font-weight:800;transition:all .3s;
}
.soc-btn:hover{border-color:var(--yellow);color:var(--yellow-d);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(255,214,0,.2);}

.contact-cta{
  background:var(--gray);border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;
  padding:50px 40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;
  text-align:center;gap:18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.contact-cta::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:-60px;right:-60px;
  width:200px;height:200px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,214,0,.15),transparent 70%);
  border-radius:50%;animation:floatShape 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.contact-cta::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-40px;left:-40px;
  width:150px;height:150px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,214,0,.1),transparent 70%);
  border-radius:50%;animation:floatShape 8s ease-in-out 2s infinite reverse;
}
.cta-rocket{font-size:80px;animation:rocketFly 3s ease-in-out infinite;position:relative;z-index:2;}
@keyframes rocketFly{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-10deg);}50%{transform:translateY(-20px) rotate(10deg);}}
.contact-cta h3{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:34px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--black);position:relative;z-index:2;}
.contact-cta p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;max-width:320px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
.cta-btns{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;width:100%;max-width:280px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
.cta-wa{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;
  background:var(--yellow);color:var(--black);padding:16px;border-radius:10px;
  font-weight:900;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;
  text-decoration:none;transition:all .3s;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(255,214,0,.4);
}
.cta-wa:hover{background:var(--yellow-d);transform:translateY(-3px);}
.cta-em{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;
  background:transparent;color:var(--black);padding:15px;border-radius:10px;
  font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;
  text-decoration:none;transition:all .3s;border:2px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15);
}
.cta-em:hover{border-color:var(--yellow);color:var(--yellow-d);}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════
   FOOTER
══════════════════════════════════════════ */
footer{
  background:var(--black);border-top:3px solid var(--yellow);
  padding:52px 40px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
footer::before{
  content:'THE AD NOVA';position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;
  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:120px;color:rgba(255,214,0,.03);
  letter-spacing:10px;pointer-events:none;white-space:nowrap;
}
footer img{height:56px;margin-bottom:18px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(255,214,0,.3));}
footer p{color:#666;font-size:13px;}
footer .yspan{color:var(--yellow);}

/* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}

/* ── PROGRESS BAR ── */
#prog{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;background:var(--yellow);z-index:9999;width:0%;transition:width .1s;box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(255,214,0,.6);}

/* ── BACK TO TOP ── */
#btt{
  position:fixed;bottom:32px;right:32px;width:48px;height:48px;
  background:var(--yellow);border:none;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;z-index:500;
  font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(255,214,0,.5);
  transform:translateY(100px);transition:transform .4s ease,box-shadow .3s;
}
#btt.show{transform:translateY(0);}
#btt:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(255,214,0,.7);}

/* ── MOBILE ── */
@media(max-width:768px){
  nav{padding:0 20px;}
  .nav-links{display:none;flex-direction:column;position:fixed;top:72px;left:0;right:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.98);padding:24px;gap:20px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--yellow);z-index:999;}
  .nav-links.open{display:flex;}
  .hamburger{display:flex;}
  section{padding:75px 20px;}
  .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px;}
  .about-highlights{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .hero-stats{gap:24px;}
  #cur,#cur-ring{display:none;}
  #btt{bottom:20px;right:20px;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- PROGRESS BAR -->
<div id="prog"></div>

<!-- BACK TO TOP -->
<button id="btt" onclick="window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})">↑</button>

<!-- CURSOR -->
<div id="cur"></div>
<div id="cur-ring"></div>

<!-- CANVAS -->
<canvas id="bgc"></canvas>

<!-- NAVBAR -->
<nav id="navbar">
  <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
    <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
    <li><a href="#packages">Packages</a></li>
    <li><a href="#clients">Clients</a></li>
    <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
  <div class="nav-logo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="The Ad Nova"></div>
  <div class="hamburger" id="ham" onclick="toggleMenu()"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
</nav>

<!-- ══ HOME ══ -->
<section id="home">
  <div class="hero-shape hs1"></div>
  <div class="hero-shape hs2"></div>
  <div class="hero-shape hs3"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-tag">🚀 Digital Marketing Agency</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">THE AD<br><span class="yt">NOVA</span></h1>
    <div class="typed-wrap">We specialize in <span id="typed"></span></div>
    <p class="hero-sub">Powerful digital strategies that launch your brand into the spotlight — driving real growth, real leads, and real results.</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="#services" class="btn-y">Explore Services</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-o">Get in Touch</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num" data-target="19" data-suffix="+">0+</div><div class="stat-label">Happy Clients</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num" data-target="10" data-suffix="+">0+</div><div class="stat-label">Services</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num" data-target="5" data-suffix="M+">0M+</div><div class="stat-label">Views Generated</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num" data-target="100" data-suffix="%">0%</div><div class="stat-label">Commitment</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-ind">
    <span>Scroll</span>
    <div class="scroll-mouse"><div class="scroll-wheel"></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ ABOUT ══ -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fi">
      <div class="sec-label">Who We Are</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title">ABOUT <span>US</span></h2>
      <p class="sec-desc">A result-driven digital marketing powerhouse built for businesses that refuse to be average.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:60px;">
      <div class="fi-l about-text">
        <p>The Ad Nova is a premium digital marketing agency specializing in transforming brands through data-driven strategies, creative content, and performance-focused advertising. We are passionate about helping businesses grow their online presence and achieve measurable results.</p>
        <p>From startups to established enterprises, we have successfully partnered with 19+ clients across diverse industries — delivering campaigns that drive traffic, generate leads, and build lasting brand authority.</p>
        <p>Our team combines strategic thinking with creative execution, ensuring every rupee you invest works harder and smarter for your business.</p>
        <div class="about-highlights">
          <div class="hbox fi-s"><span class="hbox-icon">🎯</span><h4>Result Focused</h4><p>Every campaign is built around measurable KPIs and ROI.</p></div>
          <div class="hbox fi-s"><span class="hbox-icon">⚡</span><h4>Fast Execution</h4><p>Agile team that delivers quality work on time, every time.</p></div>
          <div class="hbox fi-s"><span class="hbox-icon">🔍</span><h4>Data Driven</h4><p>We make decisions backed by analytics, not guesswork.</p></div>
          <div class="hbox fi-s"><span class="hbox-icon">🤝</span><h4>Trusted Partner</h4><p>We treat your business goals as our own mission.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ SERVICES ══ -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fi">
      <div class="sec-label">What We Do</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title">OUR <span>SERVICES</span></h2>
      <p class="sec-desc">Click any service to discover how we elevate your brand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid" id="svcGrid">
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.00s">
        <div class="svc-num">01</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">📢</div>
          <h3>Social Media Marketing</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>We create and execute powerful social media marketing campaigns across Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, YouTube, and more. Our strategies combine compelling content, targeted posting schedules, hashtag optimization, and engagement tactics to grow your brand organically and through paid promotions — turning followers into loyal customers.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.06s">
        <div class="svc-num">02</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">⚙️</div>
          <h3>Social Media Management</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>From content planning and scheduling to community management and analytics reporting, we handle everything. We create a consistent brand voice, respond to your audience in real time, monitor trends, and ensure your social media profiles remain active, engaging, and professionally managed every day of the month.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.12s">
        <div class="svc-num">03</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">🔍</div>
          <h3>SEO – Search Engine Optimization</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>We optimize your website to rank higher on Google and other search engines. Our SEO service includes technical audits, keyword research, on-page optimization, content strategy, backlink building, and performance tracking — ensuring your business is found by customers who are actively searching for what you offer.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.18s">
        <div class="svc-num">04</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">📣</div>
          <h3>Meta Ads – Facebook & Instagram</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>We design, launch, and optimize high-converting Meta ad campaigns. From audience targeting and creative design to A/B testing and budget optimization, we manage your entire ad funnel — driving maximum leads, sales, and brand awareness at the lowest possible cost per result.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.24s">
        <div class="svc-num">05</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">🌐</div>
          <h3>Google Ads</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>Our Google Ads specialists run Search, Display, Shopping, and YouTube campaigns that put your business in front of high-intent customers. We handle keyword bidding, ad copywriting, landing page alignment, and continuous optimization to maximize your ROI and reduce wasted ad spend.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.30s">
        <div class="svc-num">06</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">🧠</div>
          <h3>Strategy Planning</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>We develop a comprehensive, customized digital marketing roadmap tailored to your business objectives. This includes competitor analysis, target audience profiling, channel selection, content calendars, campaign timelines, and monthly review frameworks — giving your marketing efforts a clear, powerful direction.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.36s">
        <div class="svc-num">07</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">📈</div>
          <h3>Business Growth Consultant</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>Our growth consultants work closely with you to identify bottlenecks, uncover new revenue opportunities, and align your digital marketing with your overall business goals. We provide expert guidance, actionable insights, and strategic recommendations to accelerate your business growth in the competitive market.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.42s">
        <div class="svc-num">08</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>AI Image Generation</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>Leverage the power of artificial intelligence for stunning visual content. We create high-quality AI-generated images, product mockups, brand visuals, and social media creatives that are unique, attention-grabbing, and perfectly aligned with your brand identity — saving you time and production costs.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.48s">
        <div class="svc-num">09</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">🎯</div>
          <h3>Lead Generation</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>We build and manage targeted lead generation campaigns that attract qualified prospects to your business. Using Meta Lead Ads, Google Ads, landing pages, and CRM integration, we create a consistent pipeline of potential customers — so your sales team always has warm leads to work with.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="svc" onclick="toggleSvc(this)" style="animation-delay:0.54s">
        <div class="svc-num">10</div>
        <div class="svc-head">
          <div class="svc-icon">✨</div>
          <h3>Branding & Promotions</h3>
          <div class="svc-tog">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-div"></div>
        <div class="svc-body"><p>We build and strengthen your brand identity through consistent visual design, messaging, and promotional campaigns. From logo concepts and brand guidelines to product launches and seasonal promotions, we ensure your brand makes a lasting, professional impression across every digital touchpoint.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ PACKAGES ══ -->
