          <li>Local SEO Recommendations</li>
          <li>Weekly Reports, A/B Testing, ROI Tracking</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="pkg-st">Expected Results 🎯</div>
        <div class="pkg-tags">
          <span class="pkg-tag">More Qualified Leads</span>
          <span class="pkg-tag">Brand Visibility</span>
          <span class="pkg-tag">Better Conversion</span>
          <span class="pkg-tag">Higher ROI</span>
          <span class="pkg-tag">Business Growth</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pkg-sup"><p>👤 Dedicated Account Manager &nbsp;|&nbsp; ⭐ Priority Support<br>📞 Weekly Strategy Meetings &nbsp;|&nbsp; 📊 Growth Consultation</p></div>
